<!--
  Sitemap for https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/

  The site has three pages: the landing page (/), its Persian translation
  (/fa/) and the technical status dashboard (/status/). The two language
  versions point at each other with xhtml:link hreflang entries, matching
  the <link rel="alternate"> tags in each page's <head>.

  Three deliberate omissions. Per the sitemaps.org protocol only <loc> is
  required; <lastmod>, <changefreq> and <priority> are optional, and each of
  the three would have been either false or meaningless here:

  * No <lastmod>. The spec is explicit that this must be the date the page
    was last modified, not the date the sitemap was written. This page is
    rebuilt by hand from /docs-src and /dashboard-src, so any date baked in here would
    start drifting the moment it was committed. A stale value is worse than
    none, because a crawler that trusts it schedules re-crawls from a false
    date.

  * No <changefreq>. It is tempting to write "hourly" because the project
    republishes data every 15 minutes — but that cadence belongs to
    index.json and health.json, which this page fetches at runtime. The HTML
    document itself changes only when the dashboard is rebuilt, which is
    irregular and infrequent. Claiming "hourly" would be describing the data,
    not the document.

  * No <priority>. The spec defines it as the priority of a URL *relative to
    other URLs on the same site*. With exactly one URL there is nothing to
    rank it against, so any value would be noise.

  Also note the spec's single-host rule: a sitemap may only list URLs on the
  host that serves it. The subscription files live on raw.githubusercontent.com,
  a different host, so they are exposed as links in the page body instead —
  which is the supported way to do it.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9"
        xmlns:xhtml="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <url>
    <loc>https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/</loc>
    <xhtml:link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/"/>
    <xhtml:link rel="alternate" hreflang="fa" href="https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/fa/"/>
    <xhtml:link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/"/>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/fa/</loc>
    <xhtml:link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/"/>
    <xhtml:link rel="alternate" hreflang="fa" href="https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/fa/"/>
    <xhtml:link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/"/>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://0xradikal.github.io/Free-v2ray-Configs/status/</loc>
  </url>
</urlset>
